{"id":33,"date":"2026-03-16T13:51:53","date_gmt":"2026-03-16T13:51:53","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/?page_id=33"},"modified":"2026-03-23T11:45:10","modified_gmt":"2026-03-23T11:45:10","slug":"what-we-do","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/what-we-do\/","title":{"rendered":"What We Do"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignleft size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"444\" height=\"133\" src=\"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8\" srcset=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm.png 444w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm-300x90.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 444px) 100vw, 444px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><br>FirstDorm provides comprehensive and customised student housing solutions for Colleges <\/h1>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">India\u2019s Higher Education Is Growing <br>Campus Infrastructure Is Not<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"558\" src=\"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-2-WEST-FACING-1024x558.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-162\" srcset=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-2-WEST-FACING-1024x558.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-2-WEST-FACING-300x163.jpg 300w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-2-WEST-FACING-768x418.jpg 768w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-2-WEST-FACING-1536x837.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-2-WEST-FACING-2048x1116.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">India has over 57,000 Higher Education Institutions and 40+ million enrolled students.<br>Yet the student housing ecosystem remains fragmented, outdated, and severely undersupplied.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Large student-bed mismatch<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>&lt;5% Grade A accommodation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Aging infrastructure<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Operational burden on institutions<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rising student expectations<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Housing has become one of the biggest drivers of admissions \u2014 yet remains one of the least professionally managed assets inside and outside most colleges and this gap is widening.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">From concept to daily operations \u2014 we handle everything, so you can focus on education.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">New Hostel Development : Building for Tomorrow<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We design and construct cutting-edge student residences from the ground up \u2014 spaces that inspire, comfort, and prepare students for the future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What we deliver:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Contemporary architecture and design<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sustainable, net-zero energy buildings<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tech-enabled infrastructure<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Optimal space utilization<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Future-ready amenities<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Retrofit &amp; Upgrade Existing Hostels : Breathing New Life into Old Hostels<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Most existing hostels need transformation, not replacement. We specialize in converting outdated facilities into modern, desirable living spaces.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our retrofit process:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Structural assessment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Modern redesign<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Complete furnishing\/furbishing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Technology integration<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sustainability upgrades<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Captive Off-Campus Hostels <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For institutions needing additional capacity, we acquire land and build dedicated student residences near your campus \u2014 ensuring quality housing without campus constraints.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Operations &amp; Management : Invisible when things run smoothly. Present when it matters.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Professional management that enhances student life while freeing your team.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We manage:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>24\/7 security and access control<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Regular housekeeping<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Maintenance and repairs<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dining and meal services<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Student engagement programs<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Wellness and mental health support<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Emergency response<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-theme-palette-12-background-color has-background has-text-align-center wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/colleges\/\">Our Offering to Colleges<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FirstDorm provides comprehensive and customised student housing solutions for Colleges India\u2019s Higher Education Is Growing Campus Infrastructure Is Not India has over 57,000 Higher Education Institutions and 40+ million enrolled students.Yet the student housing ecosystem remains fragmented, outdated, and severely undersupplied. Housing has become one of the biggest drivers of admissions \u2014 yet remains one&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"_monsterinsights_sitenote_active":false,"_monsterinsights_sitenote_note":"","_monsterinsights_sitenote_category":0,"_kad_post_transparent":"enable","_kad_post_title":"hide","_kad_post_layout":"normal","_kad_post_sidebar_id":"","_kad_post_content_style":"","_kad_post_vertical_padding":"","_kad_post_feature":"","_kad_post_feature_position":"","_kad_post_header":false,"_kad_post_footer":false,"_kad_post_classname":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-33","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"aioseo_notices":[],"yoast